OL,3,GNEWSADJ gets lucky after finding lost
OL,4,ADaft Punk mixtape
OL,5,
OL,6,FDaft Punk have become household names
OL,7,Fafter storming the charts with One More
OL,8,FTime and Get Lucky - with an intimate
OL,9,Fset in 1990s Leeds lingering in the
OL,10,Fmemories of attendees. Now, those
OL,11,Frecollections have been reignited by
OL,12,Fthe discovery of a lost mix by the
OL,13,FFrench electronic duo hidden for
OL,14,Fseveral decades.
OL,16,F"It all started when I opened a show
OL,17,Ffor Daft Punk in 1997," says Ralph
OL,18,FLawson, standing on the top floor of
OL,19,Fthe Mint XL club in the city centre.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
