OL,3,GNEWSADJ gets lucky after finding lost
OL,4,ADaft Punk mixtape
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 2,500-capacity venue is empty aside
OL,7,Ffrom staff testing out a staggering
OL,8,Fnumber of lights, bouncing off the
OL,9,Fspotless floors.
OL,11,FIt is a far cry from Ralph's first
OL,12,Fclubs when he started DJing back in
OL,13,F1991.
